                <pb facs="0765" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg677"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Pearson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January 6,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. Pearson to forward the Labaree indemnity to the
                    Department, and informs him that the President cordially commends his energetic
                    and efficient action in this case.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
